  "remarks": "Key commander of the Haqqani Network, which is based in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Acts as deputy, spokesperson and advisor for Haqqani Network senior leader Sirajuddin Jallaloudine Haqqani. Liaises with the Taliban Supreme Council. Has travelled abroad. Liaises with and provides Taliban commanders in Ghazni Province, Afghanistan.\nReportedly deceased as of 2013. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol. int/en/notice/search/un/4678368",
